OL,3,GNEWSALibrary closed for urgent repairs
OL,4,Aafter asbestos found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA library has been closed for urgent
OL,7,Frepairs after asbestos and contaminated
OL,8,Fdebris were discovered beneath its
OL,9,Ffloors.
OL,11,FRoyton Library, in Oldham, closed
OL,12,Fearlier this year after staff reported
OL,13,Fsections of flooring had become
OL,14,F"bouncy" and inspectors found severe
OL,15,Fdry rot.
OL,17,FFurther investigations uncovered
OL,18,Fasbestos, a hazardous material once
OL,19,Fwidely used in construction, beneath
OL,20,Fthe building's floors the Local
OL,21,FDemocracy Reporting Service reported.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
