OL,3,GNEWSALibrary closed for urgent repairs
OL,4,Aafter asbestos found
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to a council report, the work
OL,7,Fis expected to take five to six weeks
OL,8,Fand is needed to address "immediate
OL,9,Fhealth, safety and building risks".
OL,10,FCouncillors are due to consider the
OL,11,Fplans on 19 November.
